gametitle=The Warriors (USA) [SLUS-21215] (v1.03) [CRC B99A75DE]
comment=The Warriors Freecam v0.2.0 by mostdak1ng - GPL-3.0-only

[The Warriors Freecam v0.2.0]
author=mostdak1ng
description=Select+L3 toggles the freecam. Left stick moves, right stick looks, L1/R1 drop and lift, L2 fast, R2 precise. Select+Square pauses the world, Select+Circle toggles God mode, Select+R3 carries the player, Select+Cross stops the player moving with the camera, Select+Triangle hides the readout.

// Runs entirely inside the emulated machine: no external program,
// so it works the same on desktop PCSX2 and on Android.

// per-frame tick: reads the pad, turns and moves the camera
